WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.290
The leftovers.

00:01.990 --> 00:05.242
Between Mars and Jupiter the building never finished.

00:05.692 --> 00:12.616
The pull of newly formed Jupiter stopped the pieces from coming together and made them collide instead.

00:13.066 --> 00:16.350
This is Vesta, the second most massive of them.

00:16.800 --> 00:19.989
Meteorites knocked off it still fall on the Earth.
